			"Message": "docs: benefit-focused README rewrite\n\nReplace \"X is engineered to\" with \"What X gives you\" — outcome-first\ncopy matching the website's goal-oriented direction.\n\nGenerated-By: PostHog Code\nTask-Id: 556dae83-2866-4359-85ea-c7d0d818cb34",
